'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a simple minigame loosely resembling an "AFK auto-battler" (minus the strategy and unit composition), requiring minimal interaction. Through this a player can unlock and upgrade [[Trophy]] items, and earn resources such as [[Catalyst Shards]] and [[Memetic Splinter|Memetic Splinters]].

This minigame becomes available to the player upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''4''' in a [[Realm]].

==Overview==
Expeditions are unlocked at [[Paragon]] '''4'''. They take place separately from the main game, and your progress in the main game does not directly affect your progress in them. However, your success in Expeditions can give you various rewards in the main game, which are valuable to progression. You may continue to play the main game as normal at the same time an expedition is running.

Expeditions are not affected by changing [[Realm|Realms]]; while they will initially be locked in the new Realm until reaching the required Paragon, no progress in Expeditions is lost.

Each run of an Expedition consists of 10 [[#Bestiary|Monster]] encounters, with increasing difficulty per [[#Locations|Location]]. At any point you may choose to go back to the main game and let the Expedition run its course ''("Leave")'' to revisit later once it's done to either restart the current location, or proceed to a different one. You may also choose to abandon a current run entirely ''("Give Up")''.

Enemies, rewards, and difficulty are determined by location, with some requiring specific [[#Keys|Keys]] to attempt. Upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''9''' you will have chances to receive [[#Trophy Items|Trophy Items]] as rewards, and upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''36''' you will be able to access [[#Key-Locked Locations|Key-Locked Locations]] at the cost of aforementioned keys.
