==Rewards==
For each successful monster encounter the player is rewarded with [[#Experience|Expedition XP]] and [[Catalyst Shards]], and a chance for additional rewards - which are listed below.

===Trophy Items===
{{Main|Trophy{{!}}Trophy Items}}
Upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''9''', successful monster encounters may drop [[Trophy|Trophies]]. If a player receives any one Trophy for the first time in their whole playthrough then it will also unlock the Trophy [[Item]] slot.

Succeeding drops for the same Trophy will contribute to upgrading its rarity - starting at '''''Common''''' all the way to '''''Legendary''''' rarity.

There are specific sets of possible Trophy drops per location; you may view the detailed droprates in [[/Expedition Data/]].

====Exhibits====
{{For|more information|Exhibits}}
If a Trophy is already at '''''Legendary''''' rarity and a related drop occurs after a successful monster encounter then instead the player receives an [[Exhibit]] for that specific Trophy.

