===Memetic Splinters===
{{Main|Memetics}}
{{For|more information|Memetic Splinter{{!}}Memetic Splinters}}
During succesful encounters in [[#Key-Locked Locations|Key-Locked Locations]], the player may have a chance to receive an amount of [[File:MemeticSplinter.png|x24px]] [[Memetic Splinter|Memetic Splinters]] used to upgrade the various [[Memetics]].

==Locations==
There are 12 Expediton Locations ''(aka. [[#Normal Locations|Normal Locations]])'' available to the player upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''4''', the 1st location immediately accessible at expedition level 1, the next at level 10 and the succeeding 8 more locations at +10 level increments, and the 11th and 12th locations both requiring expedition level 100. Each new location requires at least 1 complete run of the previous location.

Meanwhile, accessing [[#Key-Locked Locations|Key-Locked Locations]] (available to the player upon reaching [[Paragon]] '''36''') require the following:
* Expedition level 100
* Completion of the 12th (last) Normal Location for the first 2 key-locked locations (with location level 110)
* Completion of the prerequisite key-locked locations (with location level 110) for the other 2 key-locked locations (with location level 120)
* 100 [[#Keys|Keys]] relevant to the key-Locked location.

Each run of a key-locked location costs 100 of its aforementioned keys upfront; abandoning a current run will not refund the keys spent.

