===Missions===
[[File:Expedition Map Pin Mission Alert Example.png|thumb|x128px|right|Mission Alert Example]]
Missions are special instances of [[#Normal Locations|Normal Locations]] that have a randomly selected modifier such as: bonus stats, additional rewards, or Monster encounters unconventional to the location. They become available when the player reaches expedition level 100 and with at least 1 completion of [[#Mausoleum|Mausoleum]] location.

Monster levels are increased to level 110 for all Missions. The number of encounters per Mission is also increased when compared to non-mission instances.

Missions rotate on a daily basis, with 3 randomly selected locations having a different modifier for each. There are only 3 missions available per day, and each may be completed only once. Once a mission is completed, the location where it spawned will revert back to its "normal" state.

