====Event Missions====
[[File:Expedition Map Pin Mission Alert Egg Hunt.png|thumb|x128px|right|Mission Alert Egg Hunt]]
There are also [[Events|Event]]-specific missions that are available for the duration of an event.

Monster levels and number of monster encounters may be unique to each of these mission types. These missions may be completed once a day - they do not count against the daily completion count for regular missions.

Currently, there is only 1 recorded event-specific mission type.

